  34:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c **** /** @defgroup VirtualSpeedSensor Virtual Speed & Position Feedback
  35:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   * @brief Virtual Speed Speed & Position Feedback implementation
  36:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *
  37:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   * This component provides a "virtual" implementation of the speed and position feedback features.
  38:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   * This implementation provides a theoretical estimation of the speed and position of the rotor of
  39:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   * the motor based on a mechanical acceleration and an initial angle set by the application.
  40:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *
  41:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   * This component is used during the revup phases of the motor in a sensorless subsystem.
  42:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *
  43:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   * @todo Document the Virtual Speed Sensor "module".
