 199:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *         on which speed control is executed.
 200:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *         This method computes and stores rotor instantaneous el speed (express
 201:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *         in dpp considering the measurement frequency) in order to provide it
 202:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *         to SPD_CalcElAngle function and SPD_GetElAngle.
 203:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *         Then compute store and return - through parameter
 204:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *         hMecSpeedUnit - the rotor average mech speed, expressed in the unit
 205:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *         defined by #SPEED_UNIT. Then return the reliability state of the
 206:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *         sensor (always true).
 207:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   * @param  pHandle: handler of the current instance of the VirtualSpeedSensor component
 208:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   * @param  hMecSpeedUnit pointer to int16_t, used to return the rotor average
 209:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *         mechanical speed (SPED_UNIT)
 210:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   * @retval true = sensor information is reliable
 211:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   *         false = sensor information is not reliable
 212:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/virtual_speed_sensor.c ****   */
